先明确一下，我没有执行环境，只能把SQL写给你，你拿去在库上跑
监控逻辑主要看 pg_replication_slots，重点抓两类：active 且 confirmed_flush_lsn 长时间不动的，和 inactive 但有 catalog_xmin 挂着导致膨胀的
SELECT slot_name, plugin, slot_type, database, active, restart_lsn, confirmed_flush_lsn, pg_size_pretty(pg_wal_lsn_diff(pg_current_wal_lsn(), confirmed_flush_lsn)) AS retained_wal FROM pg_replication_slots WHERE slot_type = 'logical' ORDER BY retained_wal DESC;
再看活跃槽有没有卡住：SELECT slot_name, active, now() - backend_start AS conn_age FROM pg_replication_slots s LEFT JOIN pg_stat_replication r ON r.pid = s.active_pid WHERE s.slot_type='logical';
另外 pg_stat_replication 里的 write_lag / flush_lag / replay_lag 可以判断消费端跟没跟上。没有活跃连接但 restart_lsn 不动，基本就是没人消费，WAL 会一直堆
确认要不要把 inactive 槽的超阈值告警也一起写进去

